ng>Two Fabulous Game Modes</strong>: In Classic Mode you'll dive into relentless action and kill as many enemies as possible, facing down six bosses. Rack up your score and etch your name onto the high score board, proving yourself the ultimate Teatime Samurai. In Defend the Shrine Mode you'll hold up against endless waves of enemies hell-bent on destroying your shrine. Strategize, defend, and prove your skills in this survival challenge.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997310/extras/55ec8c31e71af011e3222c5e2ad96e45.avif?t=1748646057\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><br>Grab your friends, your gamepads, your friend's gamepads, and a hot cup of tea. It\u2019s Teatime. And this time, it's... Samurai... Teatime... Teatime Samurai.",
